                                                        PM or Admin only.

  **GET**      /projects/:id/dashboard       JWT        Project dashboard --- schedule
                                                        status, budget variance, open
                                                        items count, recent activity

  **GET**      /projects/:id/team            JWT        List project team members

  **POST**     /projects/:id/team            JWT        Add team member to project

  **DELETE**   /projects/:id/team/:user_id   JWT        Remove team member from project
