**5. Scheduling Endpoints**

  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Method**   **Endpoint**                                     **Auth**   **Description**
  ------------ ------------------------------------------------ ---------- ---------------------------------
  **GET**      /projects/:id/schedule                           JWT        Full Gantt data --- all tasks,
                                                                           dependencies, critical path
                                                                           flags, baseline vs actual

  **POST**     /projects/:id/schedule/tasks                     JWT        Create schedule task --- can
                                                                           specify parent_task_id for
                                                                           nesting

  **PUT**      /projects/:id/schedule/tasks/:task_id            JWT        Update task --- dates, assignee,
                                                                           percent complete, status

  **DELETE**   /projects/:id/schedule/tasks/:task_id            JWT        Delete task --- cascades to
                                                                           delete dependencies

  **POST**     /projects/:id/schedule/tasks/:task_id/complete   JWT        Mark task complete --- sets
                                                                           percent_complete=100,
                                                                           actual_end=today

  **POST**     /projects/:id/schedule/dependencies              JWT        Create task dependency ---
                                                                           predecessor_id, successor_id,
                                                                           type, lag

  **DELETE**   /projects/:id/schedule/dependencies/:dep_id      JWT        Remove dependency

  **POST**     /projects/:id/schedule/baseline                  JWT        Set schedule baseline --- copies
                                                                           planned dates to baseline
                                                                           columns. One-time per project.

  **GET**      /projects/:id/schedule/critical-path             JWT        Return only critical path tasks
                                                                           with float calculation

  **GET**      /projects/:id/schedule/lookahead                 JWT        Two-week lookahead --- tasks
                                                                           starting or active in next 14
                                                                           days

  **POST**     /projects/:id/schedule/weather-delays            JWT        Log weather delay --- date, hours
                                                                           lost, description

  **GET**      /projects/:id/milestones                         JWT        List milestones ---
                                                                           ?client_visible=true for
                                                                           portal-only view

  **POST**     /projects/:id/milestones                         JWT        Create milestone

  **PUT**      /projects/:id/milestones/:m_id                   JWT        Update milestone --- mark
                                                                           complete, update dates, toggle
                                                                           client visibility
  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

