                                                                upload completes

  **GET**      /projects/:id/documents/:doc_id       JWT        Document metadata

  **GET**      /projects/:id/documents/:doc_id/url   JWT        Get fresh pre-signed download URL
                                                                (15 min expiry)

  **PUT**      /projects/:id/documents/:doc_id       JWT        Update document metadata ---
                                                                name, tags, description

  **DELETE**   /projects/:id/documents/:doc_id       JWT        Soft delete document

  **GET**      /company/documents                    JWT        Company library documents ---
                                                                templates, policies

  **POST**     /company/documents/upload-url         JWT        Upload to company library
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

