**9. Trade Module Endpoints**

All trade module endpoints follow the same pattern --- prefixed with
/projects/:id/trades/:trade_module/. The trade_module path parameter
identifies the discipline (electrical, plumbing, hvac, concrete, etc.).

**9.1 Trade Phases (all modules)**

  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Method**   **Endpoint**                                              **Auth**   **Description**
  ------------ --------------------------------------------------------- ---------- ---------------------------------
  **GET**      /projects/:id/trades/:module/phases                       JWT        List all phases for this trade on
                                                                                    this project with status

  **POST**     /projects/:id/trades/:module/phases/:phase_key/start      JWT        Mark phase as started

  **POST**     /projects/:id/trades/:module/phases/:phase_key/complete   JWT        Mark phase as complete ---
                                                                                    triggers inspection scheduling
                                                                                    prompt
  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

