  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  **Method**   **Endpoint**                                                **Auth**   **Description**
  ------------ ----------------------------------------------------------- ---------- ---------------------------------
  **GET**      /projects/:id/trades/electrical/panels                      JWT        List all panels for project

  **POST**     /projects/:id/trades/electrical/panels                      JWT        Create panel --- name, location,
                                                                                      amperage, voltage, phases

  **PUT**      /projects/:id/trades/electrical/panels/:panel_id            JWT        Update panel details or status

  **GET**      /projects/:id/trades/electrical/panels/:panel_id/circuits   JWT        List circuits for panel

  **POST**     /projects/:id/trades/electrical/panels/:panel_id/circuits   JWT        Add circuit to panel

  **PUT**      /projects/:id/trades/electrical/circuits/:circuit_id        JWT        Update circuit --- status, load,
                                                                                      notes

